# The labeled IBM Telco CSV stays out of the repo on purpose: its Churn column
# is this project's held-out ground truth, and the agent has a read-only GitHub
# connector — committing the answer key next to the exam defeats the holdout.
# scripts/import-telco-population.ts's header documents the one-line download.
scripts/data/

# Eval run artifacts — cite them in the blog/README by copying numbers out,
# don't accumulate timestamped JSON in git.
scripts/eval-results/

# Local AI-tooling briefs — how this was built (an agent working a phase plan
